{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00692","headline":"郊庙歌辞 德明兴圣庙乐章 迎俎 · 李舒","name":"郊庙歌辞 德明兴圣庙乐章 迎俎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"盛牲实俎，涓选休成。\n鼎煁阳燧，玉盥阴精。\n有飶嘉豆，既和大羹。\n侑以清乐，细齐人情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李舒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00692.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00692","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}